note Graph allocation already zeroes the bootstrap object ABI; this fills the parameter payload and attribute.
fn omparam b edit uchar 25972 id view uchar 32 index ulong to void
put b 40 uchar 1
put b 42 uchar 111
put b 43 uchar 109
put b 44 uchar 101
put b 45 uchar 103
put b 46 uchar 97
put b 47 uchar 46
put b 48 uchar 112
put b 49 uchar 97
put b 50 uchar 114
put b 51 uchar 97
put b 52 uchar 109
put b 106 uchar shr index 8
put b 107 uchar and index 255
put b 618 uchar 2
put b 24944 uchar 98
for i ulong 32
put b add 24948 i get id i
end
end
